window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She was an innocent bride. Then I made her mine.</b></p> <p>The moment I saw Natasha Page standing at the altar, waiting for a fiancé whose lies had already cost him his life and put hers in danger, I knew she would be speaking her vows today after all.</p> <p>To me.</p> <p>I could have claimed her that night, ravaging her quivering virgin body as brutally as my lust demanded. But I made her beg before I tore off that beautiful dress and took what belonged to me.</p> <p>Because I don't just want her vows. I want her heart.</p> <p><i>Stolen Vows</i> includes spankings, rough, intense sexual scenes, and strong D/s themes. Intended for mature listeners.</p>"; 
